<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Affidavit — Advocates Hub Legal Draft</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Calibri', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #1e293b; margin: 30px; }
  .header-box { border: 2px solid #1e3a8a; background: #eff6ff; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; }
  .header-box h1 { margin: 0 0 6px 0; color: #1e3a8a; font-size: 18pt; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .header-box p { margin: 0; color: #475569; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .checklist-box { border: 1px solid #d97706; background: #fffbeb; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .checklist-box h3 { margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #b45309; font-size: 12pt; }
  .chk-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 6px; }
  .chk-table th, .chk-table td { border: 1px solid #fde68a; padding: 7px 10px; font-size: 9.5pt; text-align: left; }
  .chk-table th { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; width: 26%; }
  .draft-title { text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 24px 0 16px 0; color: #0f172a; text-decoration: underline; }
  .draft-body { white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.65; color: #0f172a; }
  .footer-note { margin-top: 36px; border-top: 1px solid #94a3b8; padding-top: 10px; font-size: 8.5pt; color: #64748b; text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header-box">
  <h1>ADVOCATES HUB — VERIFIED LEGAL DRAFT</h1>
  <p>Standard Indian Legal & Judicial Format • Verified by Legal Practitioners</p>
</div>

<div class="checklist-box">
  <h3>⚡ Statutory Execution Checklist & Mandatory Requirements</h3>
  <table class="chk-table">
    <tr><th>Applicable Statute</th><td>Notaries Act 1952, Indian Oaths Act 1969, Order XIX Code of Civil Procedure 1908</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Stamp Duty</th><td><strong>₹20 to ₹50 Non-Judicial Stamp Paper / e-Stamp paper as per Karnataka Stamp Act</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><th>Registration</th><td>Not applicable; Executed before Notary Public or Oath Commissioner</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Notarization</th><td>Mandatory attestation by Notary Public with Notarial Adhesive Stamp, signature and seal</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Jurisdiction</th><td>Place where deponent resides or where affidavit is submitted</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Limitation</th><td>Valid indefinitely unless challenged for perjury or material suppression</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Required Enclosures</th><td>Government Photo ID Proof of Deponent (Aadhaar Card / Voter ID / Passport); Proof of Address; Supporting documents for the facts affirmed in the affidavit</td></tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="draft-title">AFFIDAVIT</div>
<div class="draft-body">GENERAL SWORN AFFIDAVIT
(To be executed on Non-Judicial Stamp Paper of Rs. 20/- or Rs. 50/- and Notarized)

BEFORE THE HON'BLE NOTARY PUBLIC / EXECUTIVE MAGISTRATE
AT: ________________________, DISTRICT: ________________________, KARNATAKA

AFFIDAVIT OF:
I, __________________________________________________, S/o, D/o, W/o __________________________________________________, aged about _____ years, Indian citizen, residing at ____________________________________________________________________________________, bearing Aadhaar No. ________________________, do hereby solemnly affirm and state on oath as follows:

1. That I am the deponent herein and am fully conversant with the facts deposed hereinbelow, and competent to swear to this affidavit.

2. That I am a permanent and lawful resident of the address mentioned above.

3. That I am swearing this affidavit for the purpose of ___________________________________________________________________________________________________.

4. That I state that the following facts are true, genuine, and correct to my personal knowledge:
   (a) ____________________________________________________________________________________
   (b) ____________________________________________________________________________________
   (c) ____________________________________________________________________________________

5. That I have not suppressed or concealed any material facts from this Hon'ble Authority.

6. That whatever is stated hereinabove is true and correct to the best of my knowledge, information, belief, and records, and no part of it is false and nothing material has been concealed therefrom.

DEPONENT:
Signature: ____________________________________
Name: _________________________________________
Aadhaar No.: __________________________________

VERIFICATION:
Verified at ________________________ on this _____ day of _______________, 2026 that the contents of paragraphs 1 to 6 of this affidavit are true and correct. No part of it is false.

DEPONENT

SWORN & SIGNED BEFORE ME:
Identified by: _________________________________
Advocate / Oath Commissioner / Notary Public: ________________________________
Notary Registration No.: ______________________
Seal & Signature: _____________________________</div>

<div class="footer-note">
  Downloaded from Advocates Hub (https://advocateshub.in) • Valid across Karnataka & India
</div>
</body>
</html>